{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the golden age of Formula racing through a modern 2.5D arcade experience. <br>Feel the thrill of cockpit-view driving, high-speed overtakes, and weather-changing drama \u2014 all inspired by classic arcade racers of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for speed, nostalgia, and pure racing joy, this game combines pixel-shaded visuals with authentic racing tension \u2014 where every corner can define your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.poster.avif?t=1774268329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.webm?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/ba946ad31c01d79f1f651b7eec3efed3.mp4?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The iconic circuit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 10 iconic circuits inspired by legendary Grand Prix locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Monte Carle Street Circuit (Monaco-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.BergRing GP (Germany-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Fuji Highland Circuit (Japan-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.Koala Coast Raceway (Australia-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.C\u00f4te d\u2019Azur Super Battle (France-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.Long Shore City Circuit (Long Beach-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7.Kyalama Ridge Track (South Africa-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.Caspian Street Loop (Azerbaijan-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9.Monzio Grand Ring (Monza-inspired)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10.Catalynia Raceway (Spain-inspired)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You know arcade graphics are cool... but what if we add more drama?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an arcade racer with cinematic intensity \u2014 cockpit raindrops, thunder-lit skies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/e6d7b5c56c25f836f95f6999aa163b70.poster.avif?t=1774268329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/e6d7b5c56c25f836f95f6999aa163b70.webm?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/e6d7b5c56c25f836f95f6999aa163b70.mp4?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience all weather\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sun-lit streets to midnight storms, the game\u2019s weather dynamically changes the racing mood and driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/13b8f05bd763227e5b7c603d42649495.poster.avif?t=1774268329\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/13b8f05bd763227e5b7c603d42649495.webm?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/13b8f05bd763227e5b7c603d42649495.mp4?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Witness the evolution of Formula racing through four decades of speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>four eras of iconic Formula 1 machines</strong> \u2014 from the fearless 1960s pioneers to the ground-effect monsters of the 1980s and the refined aero cars of the 1990s.  <br>Current Demo Cars (80s Era) - Future Content (In Development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/cd8f52f754eb9fe91cb12442f5801694.poster.avif?t=1774268329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/extras/cd8f52f754eb9fe91cb12442f5801694.webm?t=1774268329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4159550?t=1774268329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4159550?t=1774268329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/8a66d38194dc316defe5b5596116f44943e2b2dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774268329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159550/8a66d38194dc316defe5b5596116f44943e2b2dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774268329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the golden age of Formula racing through a modern 2.5D arcade experience. <br>Feel the thrill of cockpit-view driving, high-speed overtakes, and weather-changing drama \u2014 all inspired by classic arcade racers of the 80s 